uo;s 6 grids in Osage County has 75 years of record, 1951 to 2025, and June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 135% of normal in March to April and just 39% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 55% and March to April at 145% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
